# Secrets and local state never enter the build context (docker-delivery.md, Security Note).
.env*
.venv/
.git/
.claude/
# `**/` so caches inside src/ and tests/ are excluded too, not only at the top level.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
outputs/
*.log
*.db
*.sqlite*
.streamlit/secrets.toml
